hiccup has no runtime dependencies. Nothing in node_modules is required to run
the server, and no third-party code is vendored into lib/, public/ or
server.js.

Optional, not bundled and not required:
  - pdf-parse (MIT) -- loaded lazily, only if present, only to ingest PDF
    vendor guides into the config-guide knowledge base.

